{"seq":1,"slug":"lc0037-sudoku-solver","title":"LeetCode 37 解数独","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0037-sudoku-solver","wordCount":751,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-37-解数独\">LeetCode 37 解数独</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个 9×9 的数独棋盘，其中部分格子已经填入了数字（1-9），空白格用 <code>&#39;.&#39;</code> 表示。要求填充空白格，使得每一行、每一列、每一个 3×3 的宫格内数字 1-9 恰好各出现一次。</p>\n<p>题目保证输入的数独有且仅有唯一解。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：&#10;board = [&#10;  [&quot;5&quot;,&quot;3&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;7&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;6&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;1&quot;,&quot;9&quot;,&quot;5&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;.&quot;,&quot;9&quot;,&quot;8&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;6&quot;,&quot;.&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;8&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;6&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;3&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;4&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;8&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;3&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;1&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;7&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;2&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;6&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;.&quot;,&quot;6&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;2&quot;,&quot;8&quot;,&quot;.&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;4&quot;,&quot;1&quot;,&quot;9&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;5&quot;],&#10;  [&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;8&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;.&quot;,&quot;7&quot;,&quot;9&quot;]&#10;]&#10;&#10;输出：填充完整的合法数独棋盘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>board = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"5\",\"3\",\".\",\".\",\"7\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\".\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"6\",\".\",\".\",\"1\",\"9\",\"5\",\".\",\".\",\".\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\".\",\"9\",\"8\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\"6\",\".\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"8\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\"6\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\"3\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"4\",\".\",\".\",\"8\",\".\",\"3\",\".\",\".\",\"1\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\"7\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\"2\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\"6\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\".\",\"6\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\"2\",\"8\",\".\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\".\",\".\",\".\",\"4\",\"1\",\"9\",\".\",\".\",\"5\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [\".\",\".\",\".\",\".\",\"8\",\".\",\".\",\"7\",\"9\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：填充完整的合法数独棋盘</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>board.length === 9</code></li>\n<li><code>board[i].length === 9</code></li>\n<li><code>board[i][j]</code> 是数字 <code>&#39;1&#39;</code> 到 <code>&#39;9&#39;</code> 或 <code>&#39;.&#39;</code></li>\n<li>输入棋盘保证有唯一解</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>数独是经典的约束满足问题，天然适合用回溯法求解。核心思想是逐格尝试填入数字，遇到冲突则回退。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力思路：</strong> 遍历每个空格，尝试填入 1-9，每次填入后检查整行、整列、整个宫格是否合法。时间开销极大，因为每次校验都需要遍历相关区域。</p>\n<p><strong>优化思路：</strong> 使用三组布尔数组分别记录每行、每列、每个宫格中哪些数字已被使用。这样判断某个数字能否填入某个位置只需 O(1) 时间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力回溯</td>\n<td>O(9^M)</td>\n<td>O(M)</td>\n<td>逐格尝试，每次线性校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位掩码回溯</td>\n<td>O(9^M)</td>\n<td>O(1) 额外</td>\n<td>三组标记数组，O(1) 校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束传播 + 回溯</td>\n<td>远小于 O(9^M)</td>\n<td>O(81)</td>\n<td>填入后传播约束，大幅剪枝</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 M 为空格数。虽然最坏情况时间复杂度相同，但标记数组的常数优化在实际测试中表现优异。</p>\n<p>回溯的关键在于<strong>剪枝</strong>——通过维护行、列、宫格的已用数字集合，在尝试填入之前就排除不可能的候选数字，避免大量无效递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function solveSudoku(board: string[][]): void {&#10;  const rows: boolean[][] = Array.from({ length: 9 }, () =&gt; Array(9).fill(false));&#10;  const cols: boolean[][] = Array.from({ length: 9 }, () =&gt; Array(9).fill(false));&#10;  const boxes: boolean[][] = Array.from({ length: 9 }, () =&gt; Array(9).fill(false));&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; 9; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; 9; j++) {&#10;      if (board[i][j] !== &#39;.&#39;) {&#10;        const num = Number(board[i][j]) - 1;&#10;        const boxIdx = Math.floor(i / 3) * 3 + Math.floor(j / 3);&#10;        rows[i][num] = true;&#10;        cols[j][num] = true;&#10;        boxes[boxIdx][num] = true;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  function backtrack(pos: number): boolean {&#10;    if (pos === 81) return true;&#10;&#10;    const r = Math.floor(pos / 9);&#10;    const c = pos % 9;&#10;&#10;    if (board[r][c] !== &#39;.&#39;) return backtrack(pos + 1);&#10;&#10;    const boxIdx = Math.floor(r / 3) * 3 + Math.floor(c / 3);&#10;&#10;    for (let num = 0; num &lt; 9; num++) {&#10;      if (rows[r][num] || cols[c][num] || boxes[boxIdx][num]) continue;&#10;&#10;      board[r][c] = String(num + 1);&#10;      rows[r][num] = true;&#10;      cols[c][num] = true;&#10;      boxes[boxIdx][num] = true;&#10;&#10;      if (backtrack(pos + 1)) return true;&#10;&#10;      board[r][c] = &#39;.&#39;;&#10;      rows[r][num] = false;&#10;      cols[c][num] = false;&#10;      boxes[boxIdx][num] = false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  backtrack(0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"